Here's two ways:

$ anal/sys
set proc/ind=PID_OF_INTEREST
show proc/chan

- or -

$ show dev/files/out=foo1.tmp dev1:
$ show dev/files/out=foo2.tmp dev2:
$! ... for each volume mounted on the system
$ search foo%.tmp PID_OF_INTEREST

Aaron



